# PDA mode On rotate right (report 043, phase S7b): the same panels as pda_mode (the 4.3" DSI 480x800, the FZ-M1 tablet
# 800x1280) at rotate 270, as the setting starts the launcher with it (APPLAUNCH_ROTATE=270): the picture's top at the
# landscape panel's left edge (panelshot), the device turned a quarter to the right. The display manager draws through
# rotate 270 and the touch screen is read through it (buffer orientation): Settings > Screen > PDA mode lists the three
# values with the check on On rotate right (the side the launcher runs); System > Keyboard test shows the band, "lit" is
# written with pen strokes in the letters box and Keyb, an s on the standard keyboard and its close cross are tapped,
# all through the touch path at rotate 270. A landscape app run turned gets rotate 180 (a quarter turn back, the device
# turned clockwise from portrait): its frame drawn as its own output stage would, the panelshot shows it upside down
# from the panel's own landscape. Golden at 480x800.
title pda mode right
sizes 480x800 800x1280
profile pda
env APPLAUNCH_ROTATE 270
@800x1280 env APPLAUNCH_BOARD pc-fzm1-2
@800x1280 env APPLAUNCH_PANEL_MM 150x93
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 1
keyboards 0
apps Settings CLI SSH Calculator "Mesh Hop=ip_panel_100.png"
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
home
header home
panelshot pda_right_panel
shot pda_right_home
launch Settings
key ENTER
wait 300
expect_text "On rotate right"
key DOWN
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 300
expect_rows Off "On rotate left" "On rotate right"
shot pda_right_choice
header pda_right_choice "Settings > Screen > PDA mode" "Screen > PDA mode" "PDA mode"
key ESC
key ESC
# System (the last section); from its end: Shutdown, Reboot, Keyboard test
key UP
key ENTER
key UP
key UP
key UP
key ENTER
expect_zone shown
expect_vkb zone
stroke letters 60,30 60,130 121,130
stroke letters 60,30 60,130
stroke letters 60,30 118,30 121,130
expect_text lit
shot pda_right_text
zonekey Keyb
expect_zone hidden
expect_osk shown
tapkey s
expect_text lits
shot pda_right_keyb
tapkey CLOSE
expect_osk hidden
expect_zone shown
expect_vkb zone
turnedapp on
expect_vkb auto
shot pda_right_turned
panelshot pda_right_panel_turned
turnedapp off
expect_zone shown
expect_vkb zone
